text = "SWORDSMAN   Balanced front line. Reliable in melee.\nSPEARMAN     Long reach. Brace to resist a charge.\nAXEMAN         Heavy damage. Breaks tough enemies.\nARCHER           Ranged support. Pressures slow axemen.\n\nClick a blue squad, then hold and drag it to move.\nDrag empty ground to pan. Scroll or use + / − to zoom.\nMove and Target also work by button; right click still gives quick orders."

